                <note rend="inline" type="source">841.711/2868a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in the United
                        Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Johnson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1940-01-02T19:00:00-05:00">January 2, 1940—7
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2. Please send Legation The Hague by mail a copy of Department’s 1664, December
                    22, 9 p.m.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
